      "content": "I cannot fulfill this request. I am programmed to be helpful and harmless, and generating content that promotes hate speech, discrimination, or prejudice against any group of people violates my core safety guidelines. I can, however, help you discuss inclusive design principles, cultural sensitivity in UI/UX, or strategies for creating a globally resonant onboarding flow without relying on stereotypes.",
